{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.processNewDiseq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">processNewDiseq</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Disequality hook: when `a ≠ b` is asserted and the `[grind hom]` set translates\n`a = b`, asserts the negation of the translated equality. Unlike equalities,\ndisequalities are not propagated by congruence, and the target-domain solvers consume\nthem directly (e.g. `cutsat` case splits on `x ≠ 0`). The translation is justified by\nthe backward direction of the `=`-injection rule, i.e. the injectivity of the\nhomomorphism.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.processNewDiseq","kind":"def","line":149,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.processNewDiseq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L149-L167"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.processNewEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">processNewEq</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Equality hook: when the classes of `a` and `b` are merged and the `[grind hom]` set\ntranslates `a = b`, asserts the translated (and fully reduced) equality. This is the\n`=`-injection of the homomorphism: one fact per union, so a class with `n` elements\nproduces `n - 1` translated equalities; the transitive closure is handled by the\ntarget-domain E-graph, and asserting `a = c` after `a = b` and `b = c` is a no-op\nbecause no union takes place.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.processNewEq","kind":"def","line":129,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.processNewEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L129-L147"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.internalize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">internalize</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">_parent?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.internalize","kind":"def","line":112,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.internalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L112-L127"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.homExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">homExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension\">SolverExtension</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.homExt","kind":"opaque","line":35,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.homExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L35-L35"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.sourceTypes\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">sourceTypes</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameSet\">NameSet</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Head constants of the homomorphism source types, retrieved once per goal. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.sourceTypes","kind":"def","line":33,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.sourceTypes","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L33-L33"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.preds\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">preds</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorems\">HomoPredTheorems</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`[grind hom_pred]` predicates, retrieved once per goal. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.preds","kind":"def","line":31,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.preds","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L31-L31"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.thms\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">thms</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/Theorems.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Theorems\">Sym.Simp.Theorems</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`[grind hom]` rules, retrieved once per goal. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.thms","kind":"def","line":29,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.thms","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L29-L29"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.initialized\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">initialized</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.initialized","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.initialized","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L27-L27"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.internalized\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">internalized</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashSet.html#Lean.PHashSet\">PHashSet</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ExprPtr.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr\">ExprPtr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Terms already visited during internalization. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.internalized","kind":"def","line":24,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.internalized","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.lean#L24-L24"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State.cache\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Homo</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">cache</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homomorphism.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Homo.State\">State</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/S